 по экологии</span> для проведения государственной экологической экспертизы</span></p></td><td style="width: 2.48%;border: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="2%"></td><td style="width: 26.12%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="26%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Руководитель организации</span></p></td><td style="width: 2.48%;border: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt;height: 14.25pt" width="2%"></td><td style="width: 23.96%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">По мере готовности материалов инвентаризации</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12;mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;height: 14.25pt"><td style="width: 13.7%;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="13%"></td><td style="width: 2.48%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .25pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="2%"></td><td style="width: 28.82%;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 14.25pt" width="28%"></td><t